      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Discussion at the Tech call was that this should be allowed.</p>\n\n<p>But I am wondering if this violates RFC-3986 as colon is a gen-delim reserved character?</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3986#section-2.2\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3986#section-2.2</a></p>\n\n<p>I am not positive it is not allowed, but my interpretation is that we should be encoding it.</p>",
     "created": "04/Apr/19 1:18 PM",
     "id": "20657",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12918/comment/20657",
